 "description": "Eleven pinned ViewGroup executions replayed per pinned module: ViewGroupObjectArrayEvent (ord 0) object-array events over groupwin(p1)#length(2) pinning the per-group sum(p2) Long evolution 10/21/33/36 through istream-only listener records, ViewGroupLengthWin (ord 14) groupwin(theString)#length(3) pinning istream-only delivery until each group window fills then irstream pairs evicting E2/20 and E1/1, ViewGroupStats (ord 1) four separate @name'd select-* deployments over groupwin(symbol) with #length(3)#uni and #uni price/volume variants pinning per-send single-row averages per statement plus the ordered priceAllStats/priceLast3Stats iterator snapshots, ViewGroupCorrel (ord 4) and ViewGroupLinest (ord 5) select-* per-group derived-value rows over length(1000000) with NaN rendered as the {state:nan} marker, ViewGroupMultiProperty (ord 6) groupwin(symbol, feed, volume)#uni(price) irstream datapoint pairs plus the ordered iterator snapshot, and five virtual-time grouped-window executions driven entirely by advance-time steps: ViewGroupTimeBatch (ord 10) and ViewGroupTimeLengthBatch (ord 13) with identical timelines pinning silenced sends then group flushes new 10/20 at 11000 and new 30 at 20000 plus the 21000 empty re-arm that still posts old 10/20, ViewGroupTimeAccum (ord 11) pinning istream inserts then delayed flushes old 10/20 at 15000 and old 30 at 20000, ViewGroupTimeOrder (ord 12) over SupportBeanTimestamp#groupwin(groupId)#time_order(timestamp, 10 sec) releasing E2 at 12000 and E4 at 12500 while E1 and E3 expire unobserved, and ViewGroupTimeWin (ord 16) pinning per-group expiries old 10, old 20, old 30 at 11000/15000/20000; suite milestones record nothing, every ord-1 listener invocation carries exactly the asserted last-new row because each send updates one group, AnyOrder iterator assertions stay unpinned, and the suite's pre-deploy advanceTime(1000) replays as each case's leading advance-time step because grouped time windows anchor on the first event",
